## Signal Classification (5 States)

| Signal | Resonance Ratio | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `LOCKED` | ratio >= 1.5 AND both amps > 0.6 | Both topologies strongly agree |
| `PROMOTED` | ratio >= 1.2 AND both amps > 0.4 | Dodecahedron dominates |
| `TENSION` | ratio <= 0.7 AND icosi > 0.5 | Icositetragon dominates |
| `NOISE` | both amps < 0.2 | Neither topology has signal |
| `PROVISIONAL` | all other cases | Ambiguous, use standard processing |

